<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav money supply rises in July.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav money supply rises in July.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Yugoslavia on Friday reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>YUGOSLAV MONEY SUPPLY (in billions of dinars)</p>
<p>				    (July 96)   (June 96)   (July 95)</p>
<p> M1				  4.337	 4.049	 2.566</p>
<p> M2				  6.196	 5.687	 3.366</p>
<p> M3				 29.079	29.021	10.168</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
